iew": {"username": "Chris939393", "date": "4 years ago", "rating": {"score": 1, "max_score": 5}, "comment": "I'd heard many good reviews of this place from friends that had stayed here a couple years back.||Unfortunately it seems this place has just been left to rot and has gone completely down hill. We stayed here on 2 different occasions and neither were good experiences. ||There's no denying the location of this hostel is great. Just a few minutes walk to the beach front and near all the restaurants and bars so it's a shame to see how much potential this hostel has.||The rooms in the hostel itself are completely filthy. On both occasions we stayed in 2 different rooms, both rooms were extremely dirty. Infested with cockroaches, cobwebs everywhere, bugs crawling on the floors and even a footprint on the ceiling? Also, the rooms stink. Like smell very bad.||Our room nor communal bathroom wasn't cleaned once during our stays and without judgement, there were questionable people staying at the hostel. This is NOT for backpackers.||I've stayed at many hotels all over the world including in Australia and this is by far the dirtiest I've stayed in. Unfortunately no excuses and the other hostels I've stayed in Australia have been lovely.||Just be prepared this place is not full of backpackers and it's dirty. Yes it's cheap but you get what you pay for.", "link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g261638-d285773-r838387544?m=68573&staydates=2026_11_22_2026_11_23&uguests=1_2_0&supdv=desktop&supuc=MX&supul=en"}, "source_number": 100532569, "serpapi_link": "https://serpapi.com/search.json?engine=google_hotels_reviews&hl=en&property_token=ChkIvvvF0dC-0chqGg0vZy8xMXJ5bG1ybXoyEAE&source_number=100532569"}], "serpapi_google_hotels_reviews_link": "https://serpapi.com/search.json?engine=google_hotels_reviews&hl=en&property_token=ChkIvvvF0dC-0chqGg0vZy8xMXJ5bG1ybXoyEAE", "serpapi_google_hotels_photos_link": "https://serpapi.com/search.json?engine=google_hotels_photos&proper